.64\n\\end{align*}\n\nRounding to the nearest whole number, we get $\\boxed{\\$24,\\!759}$.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{24759}$", "decode_seconds": 4.7292686039581895, "draft_calls": 146, "input_tokens": 122, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "af3aed24c9701ed7442886178d4927e92e6dd7c518b04c632fe0173621902894", "method": "relay_p", "output_hash": "ce314dc44c9279b9b87ae25aeff530f432f784b816e11b6005b4b25b586d05b1", "output_token_ids": [791, 2802, 4478, 374, 400, 16, 59, 4, 3, 824, 400, 17, 3, 4038, 11, 779, 279, 2802, 4478, 824, 2305, 374, 59060, 38118, 90, 16, 15523, 17, 11281, 4, 13244, 220, 578, 9341, 690, 5376, 555, 59060, 38118, 90, 16, 15523, 17, 11281, 4, 3, 1475, 2305, 369, 400, 20, 3, 1667, 11, 902, 374, 400, 1399, 3, 4038, 13, 220, 1226, 649, 1005, 279, 15150, 369, 24549, 2802, 311, 11294, 279, 1620, 3392, 1473, 14415, 32, 77878, 59, 2414, 7, 16, 42815, 38118, 90, 81, 15523, 77, 11281, 1315, 30876, 90, 406, 92, 14415, 271, 2940, 400, 32, 3, 374, 279, 1620, 3392, 11, 400, 47, 3, 374, 279, 12717, 11, 400, 81, 3, 374, 279, 2802, 4478, 11, 400, 77, 3, 374, 279, 1396, 315, 3115, 279, 2802, 374, 88424, 824, 1060, 11, 323, 400, 83, 3, 374, 279, 1396, 315, 1667, 382, 644, 420, 1162, 11, 400, 47, 35533, 3, 1187, 27362, 0, 931, 55976, 400, 81, 35533, 38118, 90, 16, 15523, 17, 11281, 36305, 15, 13, 8504, 55976, 400, 77, 28, 17, 3, 320, 11536, 279, 2802, 374, 88424, 6160, 23086, 398, 705, 323, 400, 83, 28, 20, 13244, 220, 1856, 36368, 1521, 2819, 1139, 279, 15150, 11, 584, 636, 1473, 59, 7413, 90, 6750, 9, 534, 32, 5, 35533, 3, 1187, 27362, 0, 931, 59, 2414, 7, 16, 42815, 38118, 90, 15, 13, 8504, 15523, 17, 11281, 1315, 30876, 90, 17, 59, 51953, 220, 20, 86639, 198, 5, 35533, 3, 1187, 27362, 0, 931, 59, 2414, 7, 16, 10, 15, 13, 6726, 20, 59, 1315, 30876, 90, 605, 86639, 198, 5, 35533, 3, 1187, 27362, 0, 931, 59, 2414, 7, 16, 13, 6726, 20, 59, 1315, 30876, 90, 605, 86639, 198, 5, 35533, 3, 1187, 27362, 0, 931, 59, 51953, 220, 16, 13, 21360, 2148, 3505, 198, 5, 35533, 3, 118